---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---
<section id="current-work" class="py-20 sm:py-24">
  <div class="container-prose">
    <SectionHeader eyebrow="Current Work" />
    <h2 class="section-title mt-8">AI applied operations, in practice.</h2>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-body text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Currently advising a multinational identity and payments platform on EU market
        entry under EUDI Digital Wallet and eIDAS 2.0. Berkeley Haas International Business
        Development project, Spring 2026.
      </p>
      <p>
        What I find interesting beyond the project itself is the workflow. I scoped the
        engagement as a Claude Project, ran three sub-workflows in parallel (first pass
        competitive scans, vertical prioritization, SKU level revenue modeling), and
        compressed the discovery phase so I could spend more time on judgment calls. This
        is the operator pattern I'm carrying into my next role.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
